=== 14: recording history can be toggled with set -o/+o history
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|status=1
|status=0
--- stderr
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (10086): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|bash-5.3$ set +o history
|bash-5.3$ echo "not recorded" >> /dev/null
|bash-5.3$ set -o history
|bash-5.3$ echo "recorded" >> /dev/null
|bash-5.3$ exit
--- file tmp
|echo 1
|echo 2
|echo 3
|set +o history
|echo "recorded" >> /dev/null

