=== 16: shopt histappend - osh ignores shopt and appends, bash sometimes overwrites
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|status=0
|status=1
--- stderr
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (10084): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|bash-5.3$   HISTSIZE=2 # Stifle the history down to 2 commands
|bash-5.3$   shopt -s histappend
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new1 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new2 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new3 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$ exit
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (10084): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|bash-5.3$   HISTSIZE=2 # Stifle the history down to 2 commands
|bash-5.3$   shopt -u histappend
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new1 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new2 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$   echo cmd new3 > /dev/null
|bash-5.3$ exit
--- file tmp
|  echo cmd new2 > /dev/null
|  echo cmd new3 > /dev/null
